@BackgroundServicesDemo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5289

### Enqueue a background job — returns 202 Accepted (processed asynchronously)
POST {{BackgroundServicesDemo_HostAddress}}/api/jobs?name=DemoJob&payload=hello
Accept: application/json

###

### List all completed jobs
GET {{BackgroundServicesDemo_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a single job's status by id (replace the GUID with one returned from the POST above)
GET {{BackgroundServicesDemo_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Accept: application/json

###

### Heartbeats recorded by the TimedHeartbeatService
GET {{BackgroundServicesDemo_HostAddress}}/api/heartbeats
Accept: application/json

###
